"""<one-line title: what this hook does>.

Mechanism
---------
<the failure mode this targets, in 2-4 sentences. Cite the train task ids
where the failure was observed: [task_XXX, task_YYY, task_ZZZ].>

Why this class (not the others)
-------------------------------
<the matcher tests <X>. <X> is a system field / tool schema field / protocol
invariant / general algorithm — i.e., a fact independent of the N evidence
simulations. Therefore the class is <CLASS>.>

Out-of-evidence probe
---------------------
<one concrete case NOT in the evidence sims where this hook's matcher would
fire. What does the handler return on it? Why is that the right answer even
